OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood photographs wanted for
OL,4,Aexhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who have grown up in Hull are
OL,7,Fbeing asked to share their childhood
OL,8,Fphotographs for an exhibition in 2027.
OL,10,FHull City Council said Hull's Youth
OL,11,FStories would explore what childhood in
OL,12,FHull has been like across different
OL,13,Fgenerations.
OL,15,FFrances Hodson, Hull Museum's community
OL,16,Fcurator of social history, said: "We
OL,17,Fknow that some of the most powerful
OL,18,Fstories about Hull's past are held in
OL,19,Ffamily photograph albums."
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
