OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood photographs wanted for
OL,4,Aexhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being invited to bring their
OL,7,Foriginal photographs to be digitally
OL,8,Fscanned at the Wilberforce House Museum
OL,9,Fon Saturday 19 September from 12:00 to
OL,10,F15:00 BST.
